# ── Frontend & Admin URLs (for reference only) ──
#    In DEVELOPMENT  → frontend & admin run as separate Vite dev servers
#      Voter Frontend : http://localhost:5173
#      Admin Panel    : http://localhost:5174
#
#    In PRODUCTION (Render) → backend serves both apps, no separate URLs
#      Voter Frontend : https://your-app.onrender.com/
#      Admin Panel    : https://your-app.onrender.com/admin
#      API            : https://your-app.onrender.com/api

# ── Default Admin Credentials (for seeding) ──
